        "original_id": "76d54bb2-1bef-5c5e-8d09-f1afccad5acf",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Dog breeds: Bullenbeisser, Can de Palleiro, Boxer\n- Places: Galicia, Spain\n- Concepts: breed origins, extinction, crossbreeding\n\nFacts:\n- The Bullenbeisser, also known as the German Bulldog, was a dog breed known for its strength and agility.\n- The Can de Palleiro, also called Pastor Galego, Galician Shepherd Dog, or Galician Palleiro, is a dog breed originating in Galicia, Spain.\n- The Boxer was bred from the Old English Bulldog and the now extinct Bullenbeisser.\n- The Bullenbeisser became extinct through crossbreeding rather than through decadence of the breed.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
